 ["Chest pain, breathlessness or marked swelling", "Fainting or very fast heartbeat"],
 ["Results disappear within months of stopping.", "Topical minoxidil is toxic to cats: avoid them licking treated skin or pillows.", "Oral minoxidil isn’t suitable in pregnancy or with some heart conditions.", "Combine with finasteride in men for a better result."],
